Parseomatic bundles the following third-party assets:

Material Design Icons (https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/)
  The `sword` and `bow-arrow` glyph outlines used for role icons in the
  Overview players table (src/ui/widgets/role-icon.ts), and the
  `sword-cross` / `heart-plus` toolbar icons for the Damage / Healing
  character views (index.html).
